{"name":"Be Yourself","hex":"#9b983d","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"be yourself","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To behave or act naturally, without regard to how this behavior is perceived by others.","To be as one usually is, as opposed to being sick, depressed, etc."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/be_yourself"}],"entries":[{"title":"Be Yourself (Audioslave song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Be Yourself\" is the first single from American rock band Audioslave's second studio album, Out of Exile (2005). The song was released in March 2005 and topped the US Billboard Mainstream Rock Tracks chart for seven weeks, as well as the Billboard Modern Rock Tracks chart for four weeks. Worldwide, the song entered the top 50 in multiple countries."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/0d/Beyourself.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Be_Yourself_(Audioslave_song)","wikidata":"Q1796334"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/0/0d/Beyourself.jpg/250px-Beyourself.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/0d/Beyourself.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/0/0d/Beyourself.jpg/250px-Beyourself.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABeyourself.jpg"}],"sounds":{"be yourself":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/54/En-au-be_oneself.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/54/En-au-be_oneself.ogg/En-au-be_oneself.ogg.mp3"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Olea europaea